+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project has no recorded decision on a version numbering scheme. No document in this repository (README, CONTRIBUTING, CHANGELOG, or any policy/decision records) states or defines a versioning policy such as semantic versioning or calendar versioning; the only related artifact is the `Version` constant in `version.go`, which records the current version string but does not constitute a documented policy.
